## Bundled fonts

The font files below are used by `zgui-text-parley`'s test suite, which runs with system font
enumeration disabled so that shaped advances and rendered pixels are the same on every machine.
The `zgui-web-demo` application also embeds the unchanged `NotoSans-Regular.ttf` file in its
WebAssembly artefact. The other files remain test fixtures.

Noto Sans Regular is Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
(https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic). Its copyright notice and full SIL Open Font
License 1.1 are in `crates/zgui-text-parley/tests/fonts/OFL-NotoSans.txt`, copied from that upstream
project's `OFL.txt`. The web demo build script includes the same file as `OFL-NotoSans.txt` beside
the distributed application.

